# SQL Analysis (MariaDB)
The SQL analysis uses the UCI Diabetes 130-US Hospitals dataset to investigate hospital readmission patterns.

## SQL workflow
- 01_dataset_setup.sql - Creates the database and table, and imports the CSV dataset.
- 02_data_quality_checks.sql - Examines encounter counts, duplicate identifiers, and missing values.
- 03_data_transformation.sql - Creates binary indicators for any readmission and readmission within 30 days.
- 04_exploratory_analysis.sql - Explores associations between readmission outcomes and patient age, hospital utilisation, medication burden, HbA1c results, hospital stay duration, and diagnosis burden.

## How to run
Execute the scripts in numerical order using MariaDB. Before running the setup script, update the CSV import path to match your local environment.
The dataset import is intended for initial setup and should not be repeated on a populated table.
